///
/// Covers: Mise en Place, Food Storage, Cross-Contamination, Knife
/// Mechanics (grip, cuts, safety), and the General Tips & Tricks bank.
///
/// EDITING: Each block is plain text between triple-quotes. Safe to
/// tweak wording or numbers inside any block without touching anything
/// else in this file or any other file in the app.
